UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under GASB 34, paragraph 102, proprietary fund operating revenues arise from the fund''s principal ongoing operations. Water service charges ($6,400,000) and tap fees ($310,000) total $6,710,000 in operating revenues. The gain on disposal and investment income are nonoperating items.
Wrong (B): $6,400,000 excludes tap fees, which are part of the utility''s core water operations and qualify as operating revenue.
Wrong (C): $6,805,000 incorrectly includes the $150,000 gain on disposal plus investment income; equipment disposals are nonoperating.
Wrong (D): $6,955,000 incorrectly includes the $150,000 gain on disposal and the $95,000 investment income, both of which are nonoperating.$EXPL$
