  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under ASC 260-10-45-2, an entity must present EPS for discontinued operations on the income statement or in the notes. The per-share amount is the $180,000 loss divided by 200,000 weighted-average shares, yielding $(0.90).
Wrong (A): $(0.63) does not correspond to any valid calculation using the given income and share figures.
Wrong (B): $(1.80) incorrectly doubles the loss amount or misapplies the share count in the calculation.
